        "category": "news"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d5542e1b03623fef",
      "text": "US President Donald Trump told the United Nations General Assembly on Tuesday that he would have to decide whether to “annihilate” Iran if Tehran fails to reach a deal to end the war in the Middle East.\n \nHe added that he believed an agreement was possible after the US midterm elections in November.",
